    """
    Return attribute names and descriptions defined by interface.

    Parameters
    ----------
    all : bool, optional
        If True, return all public attributes of the instance (including
        those not explicitly defined in the interface).  If False,
        return only the attributes that are directly defined in the
        class (excluding methods, builtins and private members).

